            "text": "{\"claims\":[{\"claimString\":\"European Climate Law (binding net‑zero by 2050, 55 % GHG cut by 2030)\",\"startOffset\":187,\"endOffset\":256,\"segmentIds\":[\"0\"],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"The provided documents explicitly state that the European Climate Law sets a binding target to achieve climate neutrality by 2050 at the latest.\"},{\"claimString\":\"55 % GHG cut by 2030\",\"startOffset\":235,\"endOffset\":255,\"segmentIds\":[],\"score\":0,\"rationale\":\"The provided documents mention the European Climate Law and the 'Fit for 55' package, but they do not explicitly state that the European Climate Law mandates a 55% greenhouse gas reduction by 2030.\"},{\"claimString\":\"2023 emissions 35 % below 1990 level\",\"startOffset\":259,\"endOffset\":295,\"segmentIds\":[],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"The provided documents mention GHG inventories for 1990-2023 and discuss various climate targets, but they do not state the specific percentage reduction of 2023 emissions compared to 1990 levels.\"},{\"claimString\":\"EU Emissions Trading System (ETS) covering power, industry and aviation\",\"startOffset\":484,\"endOffset\":555,\"segmentIds\":[],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"The provided documents mention the existence of the European-wide emissions trading system (ETS), but they do not specify which sectors (such as power, industry, or aviation) it covers.\"},{\"claimString\":\"Effort Sharing Regulation (national GHG limits)\",\"startOffset\":783,\"endOffset\":830,\"segmentIds\":[\"1\"],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"Document 3 explicitly states that the Effort Sharing Regulation (ESR) is part of a legal framework that includes binding greenhouse gas (GHG) emission reduction and removal targets for Member States.\"},{\"claimString\":\"LULUCF Regulation (forests & soils)\",\"startOffset\":832,\"endOffset\":867,\"segmentIds\":[],\"score\":0.9,\"rationale\":\"The LULUCF regulation is explicitly identified as 'land use, land use change and forestry', which directly concerns forests and land use (soils are implicitly part of land use/forestry contexts in this regulatory framework). Document 1 also links carbon removals by forests and soils to the necessary acceleration for meeting targets.\"},{\"claimString\":\"EU carbon sink fell ~30 % between 2014‑2023\",\"startOffset\":892,\"endOffset\":935,\"segmentIds\":[],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"The provided documents mention 'Carbon dioxide removal from the atmosphere' and 'carbon removals by forests and soils' in the context of trends and policy targets, but they do not provide specific numerical data or percentages regarding the change in the EU carbon sink between 2014 and 2023.\"},{\"claimString\":\"renewable‑energy share 24.5 % of final energy (2023)\",\"startOffset\":1122,\"endOffset\":1174,\"segmentIds\":[],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"The provided documents do not contain any specific data or statistics regarding the renewable energy share for the year 2023.\"},{\"claimString\":\"Renewable share up from 10.2 % in 2005\",\"startOffset\":1177,\"endOffset\":1215,\"segmentIds\":[],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"The provided documents discuss trends in GHG emissions and renewable energy shifts in the EU, but they do not contain any specific statistical data regarding the renewable energy share in 2005.\"},{\"claimString\":\"primary energy use down 19 % since 2005\",\"startOffset\":1217,\"endOffset\":1256,\"segmentIds\":[],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"The provided documents discuss GHG emission reductions and GDP growth, but they do not contain any data or statistics regarding primary energy use.\"},{\"claimString\":\"Transport emissions still 18 % above 1990 level\",\"startOffset\":1463,\"endOffset\":1510,\"segmentIds\":[],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"The provided documents mention that progress in the transport sector has been 'less pronounced' and that there is a 'significant gap' in emissions, but they do not provide a specific percentage for transport emissions relative to 1990 levels.\"},{\"claimString\":\"modest decline since 2007\",\"startOffset\":1512,\"endOffset\":1537,\"segmentIds\":[],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"The documents state that net GHG emissions in the EU have reduced by more than one third since 1990, but they do not provide specific data regarding transport emissions or their trends since 2007.\"},{\"claimString\":\"2021 EU Adaptation Strategy\",\"startOffset\":1674,\"endOffset\":1701,\"segmentIds\":[],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"Document 1 and Document 3 both explicitly cite a 2021 Communication from the Commission titled 'Forging a Climate-Resilient Europe the New EU Strategy on Adaptation to Climate Change', confirming the existence of the strategy.\"},{\"claimString\":\"EU Climate Adaptation Plan (due 2026)\",\"startOffset\":1736,\"endOffset\":1773,\"segmentIds\":[],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"The provided documents explicitly state that the EU Climate Adaptation Plan is due to be published in late 2026.\"},{\"claimString\":\"All Member States have adaptation policies\",\"startOffset\":1776,\"endOffset\":1818,\"segmentIds\":[\"2\"],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"The provided documents explicitly state that all European Member States have dedicated adaptation policies in place.\"},{\"claimString\":\"2018 Governance Regulation\",\"startOffset\":2128,\"endOffset\":2154,\"segmentIds\":[],\"score\":0.5,\"rationale\":\"While Document 1 mentions reporting 'under the Governance Regulation' and Document 2 mentions a 'Review of the Regulation on the Governance of the Energy Union and Climate Action', the documents do not explicitly state that a '2018 Governance Regulation' exists.\"},{\"claimString\":\"contributes ~6 % of global emissions\",\"startOffset\":2510,\"endOffset\":2546,\"segmentIds\":[\"3\"],\"score\":1,\"rationale\":\"The provided documents explicitly state that Europe accounts for 6% of current global emissions, which supports the claim regarding the EU's contribution.\"}],\"segments\":{\"0\":{\"id\":0,\"startOffset\":693,\"endOffset\":841},\"1\":{\"id\":1,\"startOffset\":947,\"endOffset\":1206},\"2\":{\"id\":2,\"startOffset\":185,\"endOffset\":257},\"3\":{\"id\":3,\"startOffset\":2557,\"endOffset\":2607}}}"
